r"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/133408f55b6f5be88ec7c7f54f23721abb0c9a57.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1WkNM65ERq</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1WkNM65ERq</guid><pubDate>Sun, 12 Jul 2026 11:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>最胖最呆的"超级英雄"，AI的发展让大白或许真的不远了</title><description>《超能陆战队》未来世界的超级都市旧京山，热爱发明创造的天才少年小宏，在哥哥泰迪的鼓励下参加了罗伯特·卡拉汉教授主持的理工学院机器人专业的入学大赛。他凭借神奇的微型磁力机器人赢得观众、参赛者以及考官的一致好评，谁知突如其来的灾难却将小宏的梦想和人生毁于一旦&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116879230243083&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/e49dcb401e82dfa96d37f1b3f1eb7d9a5868202b.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1t6Mh6REfv</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1t6Mh6REfv</guid><pubDate>Fri, 10 Jul 2026 11:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>岳云鹏都不搞笑了？这部算导的新剧到底有多狠</title><description>《悬案》该剧以2016年3月公安部刑侦局主抓的“疑难命案积案攻坚行动”所侦破的多起案件为基础，改编创作两起90年代悬案&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116872284478841&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/8fe2be389a1ebd09b641a0b89469df8caf3a98b4.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1A7TQ6ME29</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1A7TQ6ME29</guid><pubDate>Mon, 06 Jul 2026 11:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>整片被黄色填满，情节简单到爆炸，就这都能拿到近8分的评价？</title><description>《小黄人大眼萌》从地球诞生之初，一种奇怪的生物便出现在这颗蓝色的星球上。他们不断进化、蜕变，终于成为我们所熟悉的小黄人的模样。小黄人们毕生寻找邪恶的老大，以成为他的部属为荣，但是千百万年来的努力最终化成一场空&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116860439762664&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/5ba7dabf9210a2283a5392698d9f630e1731e11a.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1MsMF6vEAH</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1MsMF6vEAH</guid><pubDate>Sat, 04 Jul 2026 11:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>建议全屏观看！拍电影好像很简单！超级简单的剧情，却能拿到8.5分</title><description>《风的气息》伊朗偏远的小山村，一对残障父子家里突然停电，前来维修的电工目睹了艰难维生的家庭情况，踏上了帮助他们的两天一夜的旅程。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116850222438049&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/fa5c9eefb8ba3e8ed3534698b9b1379864cd06e3.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1aHTE6xEb5</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1aHTE6xEb5</guid><pubDate>Thu, 02 Jul 2026 11:51:56 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>天赋重要还是努力重要？为啥国外的贫民窟那么容易出球星？</title><description>《金球》来自喀麦隆的米拉给非洲人民带来了至高的荣誉，尽管他的家境贫寒，在为家里干农活的同时还要上学，米拉还是决心自己赚钱来买一个真正的足球。幸运的是，他从一名女医生那里得到了一个礼物：一个旧的皮球。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116798045363062&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/bb70c9bd4c0cc8aead41cba04a439f0dd4341a40.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1t5j16EEFD</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1t5j16EEFD</guid><pubDate>Tue, 23 Jun 2026 11:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>喝点酒教出了一个班的大学生？拔叔的演技巅峰，最后一舞尽显中年男人的魅力</title><description>《酒精计划》四位中学教师的故事。他们决定进行一项实验，每天保持一定的酒精摄入量，以观察其对生活和工作的影响。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116769792596991&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/a1d3174d56aa0caf7e4c47e6b464b875c02e9b98.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1nUjc67EzF</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1nUjc67EzF</guid><pubDate>Thu, 18 Jun 2026 11:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>真实事件改编，挖煤小伙用炮仗造火箭，最后被航天局录取</title><description>《十月的天空》1957年，苏联卫星发射成功，美国民众萌发了危机意识。一个矿井小镇的普通高中生霍默此刻却为自己的未来忧虑，他在球队选拔中落选，而体魄强健的哥哥一直更受父亲约翰认可，不甘于平庸的霍默萌生了制作火箭的想法&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116758635681993&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/1425406ddec07a8a02394b2b263524f94caafa5e.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1p7ju66E8Y</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1p7ju66E8Y</guid><pubDate>Tue, 16 Jun 2026 11:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>《玩具总动员》这个系列真的就是一封情书，跨越了31年才邮递给成年的你</title><description>《玩具总动员5》胡迪、巴斯光年、翠斯等“元老级”玩具将跟随小主人邦妮的成长脚步，共同迎接数字时代下的全新挑战。随着无所不能的科技产品逐渐走进童年世界，一批充满科技感的崭新角色也随之重磅亮相&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116746740637077&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/43321bae88e92fbf6ba96fb06165b578a18fa0c6.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1jzJF6LEEw</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1jzJF6LEEw</guid><pubDate>Sun, 14 Jun 2026 10:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>看心理医生不如看电影？真正的脑洞大开！终于知道为什么脑子里会有声音了</title><description>《头脑特工队》可爱的小女孩莱莉出生在明尼苏达州一个平凡的家庭中，从小她在父母的呵护下长大，脑海中保存着无数美好甜蜜的回忆。当然这些记忆还与几个莱莉未曾谋面的伙伴息息相关，他们就是人类的五种主要情绪：乐乐、忧忧、怕怕、厌厌和怒怒&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116731120981032&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/b6573105a6cebd2fa25ec1a992cf9c3cdbe06441.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1U5Eq6AELx</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1U5Eq6AELx</guid><pubDate>Fri, 12 Jun 2026 11:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>作为老二，它总是被忽略！可如今看这部上世纪的动画却能发现平庸中的精彩</title><description>《玩具总动员2》小主人参加夏令营去了，伍迪因为破旧而没被带去。留在家里的伍迪恰巧被一个玩具收藏家发现了，认为他是近代最具代表性的玩具。于是将伍迪被偷了出来放在颇富盛名的文化博物馆内展览&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116718991055683&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/31e0cea56cb5ab880b05fd333ca251cfd4a5e297.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV15SEE64E5q</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV15SEE64E5q</guid><pubDate>Tue, 09 Jun 2026 11:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item></channel></rss>